{
  "name": "PDF 转文本 Webhook 接口 (供应用与自动化集成)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# PDF 转文本 Webhook 接口\n\n向此 Webhook POST `{ \"url\": \"https://example.com/doc.pdf\" }`，实时获取清洗后的文本、元数据与 OCR 指标。\n\n## 配置（仅需一次）\n\n**1. 获取 Apify Token** — https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations\n\n**2. 创建 n8n 凭据**\n凭据 → 新建 → **Header Auth**\n- 名称: `Apify API`\n- Header name: `Authorization`\n- Header value: `Bearer 你的_APIFY_TOKEN`\n\n所有 HTTP 节点均已配置指向该凭据，工作流文件中不包含任何密钥。\n\n## 计费说明\n\n按事件付费：成功返回文本的 PDF 每份 $0.002（千份起价 $2.00）。损坏文件、404 与空文件免费。扫描件 OCR 页面每页 $0.005。\n\n当前价格详情：https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/pdf-text-extractor/pricing\n\nActor 页面：https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/pdf-text-extractor\n模板与开源仓库：https://github.com/sumitrmardy/pdf-text-extractor-api",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "t3-sticky",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "pdf-extract",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "t3-webhook",
      "name": "PDF 接收 Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        320,
        100
      ],
      "webhookId": "pdf-extract"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/sumitr_mardy~pdf-text-extractor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ urls: [ ($json.body && $json.body.url) || $json.url || '' ], ocrMode: ($json.body && $json.body.ocrMode) || $json.ocrMode || 'auto' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "t3-extract",
      "name": "提取 PDF 文本 (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "apify-api",
          "name": "Apify API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    url: item.url || '',\n    status: item.status || 'unknown',\n    subStatus: item.subStatus || '',\n    pageCount: item.pageCount || 0,\n    pagesExtracted: item.pagesExtracted || 0,\n    ocrPages: item.ocrPages || 0,\n    charCount: item.charCount || 0,\n    title: item.title || '',\n    text: item.text || '',\n    error: item.error || ''\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "t3-format",
      "name": "格式化响应 JSON",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "t3-respond",
      "name": "返回提取结果",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1040,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "PDF 接收 Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "提取 PDF 文本 (Apify)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "提取 PDF 文本 (Apify)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "格式化响应 JSON",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "格式化响应 JSON": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "返回提取结果",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
